[[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><p><a href=\"#/2585026\">Op. 7005R37 DOOR MIRROR COVER (ONE), LEFT OR RIGHT - R.R</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2585024\">Op. 7005R35 DOOR MIRROR REFLECTOR (ONE), LEFT OR RIGHT - R.R</a></p><p>1. Undo the fixing bolts and remove the motor.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223003176.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical connector.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000694.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Left door mirror</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223005435\">See P60 LEFT DOOR MIRROR</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000694.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Right door mirror</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223005436\">See P061 RIGHT DOOR MIRROR</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223003177.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Connect the electrical connector (1a) and fit the motor (1b) in its seating, fitting the holes (1c) on the pins (1d) located on the external rearview mirror.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000694.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Left door mirror</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223005435\">See P60 LEFT DOOR MIRROR</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000694.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Right door mirror</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223005436\">See P061 RIGHT DOOR MIRROR</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223003178.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>Tighten the fixing bolts.</p><p><a href=\"#/2585024\">Op. 7005R35 DOOR MIRROR REFLECTOR (ONE), LEFT OR RIGHT - R.R</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2585026\">Op. 7005R37 DOOR MIRROR COVER (ONE), LEFT OR RIGHT - R.R</a></p><p>Connect the battery negative terminal.</p>"]]